  "question": {
    "text": "Out of all the patients in a hospital <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>89</mn><mo>%</mo></math> are found to be suffering from heart ailment and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>98</mn><mo>%</mo></math> are suffering from lungs infection. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>%</mo></math> of them are suffering from both ailments, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> can not belong to the set:"
  },
