  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;is set of people suffered from heart ailment and lungs infections respectively.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>H</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>L</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>%</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>U</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math>&nbsp;is the universal set.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>H</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>L</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>87</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>87</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>89</mn></math></p>"
